{"id":"b4cf3e38d764f1d6","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbalmostpositive.md","title":"非线性规范系数非负的almost-positive类","display":"df-pbalmostpositive — 非线性规范系数非负的almost-positive类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbalmostpositive","aliases":["27-df-pbalmostpositive"],"display":"df-pbalmostpositive — 非线性规范系数非负的almost-positive类","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbcoeff]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.4, Definition 13.13","source_printed_pages":"604","source_pdf_pages":"628","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbalmostpositive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbalmostpositive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbalmostpositive — 非线性规范系数非负的almost-positive类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.4, Definition 13.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"604"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"628"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,c_f\">\\(\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,c_f\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|\\ge2\\Longrightarrow c_f(S)\\ge0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|\\ge2\\Longrightarrow c_f(S)\\ge0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>条件只约束规范多项式中的非线性项，常数与一次项可以为负。它不等于函数值非负，也不等于各坐标递增。n≤1时所有伪布尔函数均属于本类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbcoeff]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,c_f$ 见 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,c_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|\\ge2\\Longrightarrow c_f(S)\\ge0)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1139,"backlinks":[{"id":"18018df5c235cd7a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S\\subseteq[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$。$\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbalmostpositive]]，$\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbpolar]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbalmostpositive|df-pbalmostpositive — 非线性规范系数非负的almost-positive类]]"}],"outgoing":["7937ecc11ac59760"]}